WEBVTT

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.230
Soon after Tokyo was 
swallowed by a Black Point,

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.960
four other Black Points appeared in Japan,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.730
and Z/X from the Red, Blue, 
White, Black, and Green worlds

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.020
divided the nation amongst themselves.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:24.210
Now the five worlds intermingle here,

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.770
making Japan a microcosm 
of the world itself.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.940
The appearance of the Black Points

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:34.050
Osaka

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.050
turned the citizens around 
them into refugees,

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:37.490
the vast majority of which 
fled to the larger cities.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.290
Osaka was no exception.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.600
The sudden increase in its population

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.640
shut down city functions 
and plunged it into chaos.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:52.310
Kobe, however, was fortunately 
far away from the Black Points,

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:51.500
Kobe

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:54.730
and though there was temporary confusion,

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:58.220
peace returned comparatively rapidly.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:02.760
It was rare to see a Z/X 
as part of everyday life.

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:04.580
However...

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.220
Put that angel down.

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:15.050
Or I'll kill you, too.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:56.730
Time out! Time out!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.440
What did you just say?

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:01.200
Kobe - Residential Area
December 24th 22:50

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.990
She's an angel?

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.610
And you're going to kill me?

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:05.990
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.320
That's right.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.280
She's got wings on her back,

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.080
and she came down from the sky.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.870
The Proud  Fierte

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.870
You didn't think she was human, did you?

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.780
Well, you're right, but...

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:12.750
Or, what?

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:16.250
You're a human, and you think 
you're going to save a Z/X?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.880
Asuka Tennoji

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.880
You've got a Z/X with you, too!

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.140
He's special.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.470
That's not fair!

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.640
The Black Blade  Sieger

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.640
Listen, kid.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.140
It talks?!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.070
Let me give you some advice.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:33.400
It would be in your best interests 
to do as the girl says.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.670
So, what will it be?

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:41.530
Leave the angel and go, 
or be ripped to pieces with her?

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.160
That...

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.680
That should be obvious!

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.700
It doesn't matter if she's human or a Z/X.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:57.170
There's no way I'm just gonna 
stand back and watch

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.170
while someone gets killed!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:00.930
I see.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.020
Sieger.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.240
Yes, yes.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.860
That's the sensation I love.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.980
It's been so long, I'd almost forgotten it.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:18.980
I love the way it feels 
to tear a human apart.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.730
Well?

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.530
Do you still intend to save the angel?

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.330
Of course!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.540
You're a true fool, it seems.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.760
Let's kill him, Ayase.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:34.790
I'd prefer a young woman, 
but I'll deal with it.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.500
<i>Damn.</i>

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.050
<i>She's light, but I can't run 
away carrying her, can I?</i>

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.310
Nope.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.050
Isn't there some other way?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.820
Next time, I'll really kill you.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:06.320
You don't mind, do you, Ayase?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.960
<i>Listen to me, Asuka Tennoji.</i>

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:19.910
That voice...

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:21.960
The shrine priestess from this afternoon?

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.800
<i>You are my chosen.</i>

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:31.560
<i>Do you truly wish to save that Z/X?</i>

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.770
Yes, I do.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.060
I want to save her!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:42.070
<i>Then raise your Card Device 
and say this word...</i>

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.950
Capture!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:50.820
A card device?

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.580
The punk's a Z/X user?

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.330
Asuka...

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.390
Huh?

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:39.950
She's gone.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.460
His capture worked?

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.070
Seriously?

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.840
A powerful Z/X like that?

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.590
No. She didn't disappear.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.050
She went inside this thing.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:56.180
<i>When you want her to 
appear, yell "Activate."</i>

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:59.100
<i>Now you, Asuka Tennoji,</i>

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.940
<i>have become a Player with the 
ability to capture and command a Z/X.</i>

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:07.210
What're you gonna do?

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:10.590
The angel you're after is gone now.

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:13.690
So it seems.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.530
But didn't you know?

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:21.210
I can solve that problem by killing you.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.930
What? Seriously?

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.950
Sieger, we're leaving.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:32.460
What?

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:38.040
Not prepared to actually kill someone, huh?

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.310
She's still a little girl.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.480
Shut up.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.570
What's your name, kid?

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.340
Asuka Tennoji.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.480
I'm Sieger.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.940
The girl is Ayase Kamiyugi.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.040
Sieger.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.160
What? They're just names.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:57.990
See you around.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:08.840
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms
December 24th 23:07

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:07.670
Okay!

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:08.840
Activate!

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:17.210
She really...

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:19.860
...appeared.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:41.120
Wh—

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:42.160
Shh! Shh!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.540
This is the boys' dorm!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:48.540
Why did you drag me to a place like this? 
What are you going to do with me?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.510
Drag you...?

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:52.550
Listen.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.780
If you release me right now,

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:57.000
I won't have to do anything unreasonable.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:57.680
But...

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.560
I'm not going to do anything!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:02.560
A Card Device?

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.770
What? You recognize it?

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.310
Of course I do.

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.610
What's your name?

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.370
Asuka Tennoji.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:18.870
Asuka?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.830
Have we met somewhere?

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:25.990
No way. I don't know any angels.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.890
By the way, what's your name?

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:29.000
Fierte.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.500
Fierte, huh?

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:37.300
<i>How shameful, for an angel 
to be captured by a human.</i>

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:43.310
<i>No, it was I who took his hand, wasn't it?</i>

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.310
<i>But why did I...</i>

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.030
Um, Fierte?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.110
Are your wounds all right?

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.680
They looked pretty bad.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:01.780
Yes, they've almost completely closed.

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:06.380
If you can give me the resources, 
I should fully heal overnight.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.170
Resources?

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.810
You don't even know what that is?

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:12.420
Not a clue.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:22.300
So these "resources" are 
to you what air is to us?

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.660
That's more or less correct.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.060
Right now, I'm receiving them 
through your Card Device.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.560
Through this thing, huh?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:33.220
I hate to admit it,

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:38.200
but the reason I'm able to exist 
right now is because of you.

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:40.820
And that's why...

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.200
I'm going to stay here for a while.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.180
Hold on a second!

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.670
Is there a problem?

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:48.990
There's a big one!

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:52.190
This is a boys' dorm, 
and girls aren't allowed.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.040
That's not a problem at all.

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.920
I'm not a girl, I'm an angel.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.190
Capture!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.760
<b>No Way</b>

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.160
What are you doing?

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.430
Let me out!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.230
This is why I hate humans!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.380
You captured me without even asking!

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.300
I said I was sorry!

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.310
That justifies nothing!

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:18.450
Show a little discretion!

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:19.820
What a pain...

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:22.730
Um...

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:26.330
If it's really a problem, I'll leave.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.000
No, um...

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.210
Well, it's winter break right now.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:33.960
Most of the residents have gone home.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.460
It'll work out, I'm sure.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.340
Oh, good!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:42.200
To tell you the truth, 
I had nowhere else to go.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.470
Oh, no!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.510
What's wrong?

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:49.180
There's only one bed in this room.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:56.860
Kitano, Kobe

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:00.610
Kitano, Kobe
December 25th 00:02

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:02.490
Wow, what a huge mansion!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.480
But is it okay for us to 
enter without permission?

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.990
This is one of my family's villas.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.490
It's been a long time since 
I've come here, though.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.880
Hey, Ayase.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:26.110
About where that Asuka boy lives...

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:27.400
What did you find out?

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:29.640
It's some high school dorm.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.890
How far?

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.110
I could get us there in three minutes.

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:33.950
I see.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.650
Then we'll make this place 
our base for a while.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.250
I'm going to bed.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.140
Yeah, good idea.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:45.240
I don't care where I sleep, 
as long as it's next to you—

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:54.080
You're no fun.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:59.540
Jeez, is it really that big a deal?

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.920
Oh, right.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:08.430
Looks like we're not the only 
ones interested in that angel.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:08.970
Mountaintop Hotel

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.430
Mountaintop Hotel
December 25th 00:26

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.640
Target located.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.570
They're hiding in the dormitory of 
the Seiryuu Academy High School.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.370
I see.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:38.960
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.000
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms
December 25th 06:58

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.420
Why are you sleeping on the floor?

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.470
Don't mind me.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.090
You really like the TV that much?

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:58.940
Yes. They don't exist in our world.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.160
Fierte, you don't want to wash your face?

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:07.510
No. Angels don't need to wash 
their faces or their bodies.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:08.970
Aw, come on.

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:11.320
Next you'll be telling me you 
don't use the bathroom.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.200
Right, we don't.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:14.700
You're kidding!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.450
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorm - Cafeteria

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.710
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorm - Cafeteria
December 25th 07:24

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.980
Fierte really is an angel.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:24.710
What are you mumbling about, Asuka?

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.710
Cafeteria Lady
Wakagi

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.590
Nothing.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.590
Can I have a little more bread, ma'am?

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:39.230
Aina Mikage

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:38.100
Good morning, Tennoji!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.230
Ah, good morning.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:44.360
Oh, you're from Café Broccolo... uh...

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.360
Aina. Aina Mikage.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:51.080
Honestly, how many times have 
I told you my name now?

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:52.130
Sorry.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.370
Oh, that's right, we 
go to the same school.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.300
Um, what year are you?

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:57.730
The same as you.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.020
Second year.

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.840
We're in different classes, though.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.880
You eat a lot more than I 
would've expected, Tennoji.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:09.620
Yeah... I've been really hungry lately.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.380
Maybe it's a growth spurt.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.890
Here you go, Fierte.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:24.650
I told you, I don't need food.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.560
All I need is a sufficient 
amount of resources.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.150
No!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:33.850
You need to eat real food, not just that 
air stuff, or your wounds aren't gonna heal.

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:34.910
But I said...

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:36.410
Eat.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.040
If you insist...

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:46.060
How do you like our cafeteria's bread?

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.720
Pretty good, right?

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:48.760
Yes...

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:52.140
Have the omelet, the salad, 
and the sausages, too.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.300
Right.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:56.670
I even went and got a job 
in the same place as him,

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:59.480
and he won't even remember my name.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:08.940
<i>Am I really that forgettable?</i>

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.200
<i>Wait, come to think of it...</i>

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:12.740
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.160
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms
December 25th 15:41

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.160
Crap.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.460
I'll barely break even again this month.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:17.990
Asuka!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:18.660
What?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:20.790
What is this?

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.280
That's a hot spring.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:24.290
A hot spring?

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.790
You immerse yourself 
in hot water and relax.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.550
It's especially nice on cold days. 
It warms you right to the core...

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:36.060
Maybe an angel wouldn't understand.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:36.800
Asuka!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.790
I request a hot spring!

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.310
Huh?

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:44.190
Tomitaka Hot Springs

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:44.190
Look, this "reporter" woman says 
it helps heal injuries, too!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:47.440
Didn't you say resources were 
all you needed to heal?

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.820
I don't think someone who forced 
me to eat should say that.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:54.070
Yeah, but a hot spring...

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:57.480
Actually, if that's what you want, 
the dorm's shared bath is pretty big.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:59.080
Then let's go there!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.920
You're crazy.

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:02.890
What if someone sees you?

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:08.460
I'm here!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.130
Wh-What?

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.790
What are you thinking?

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.840
Even if there aren't that many 
people here over winter break,

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:23.580
you still can't come in the boys' dorm!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:26.310
You've got someone here 
already, don't you, Tennoji?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.120
How did you know?

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:29.810
I knew it.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:32.570
<b>For Dogs and Cats</b>

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.570
Pet food?

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.450
That's right. Human food has a lot of salt,

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.700
so you can't give it to animals.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.320
Wait!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:43.430
Is it a doggy or a kitty?

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:44.580
No!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.300
Shh, shh!

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.260
<i>Ever since yesterday, this 
stuff keeps happening to me!</i>

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.720
No, Mikage! It's not like that!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.450
What's not like that?

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:01.970
You just threw this over my head!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:04.650
Tennoji, who is this?

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:06.480
She's, um...

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:09.220
My little sister!

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:17.910
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Women's Shared Bath

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.370
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Women's Shared Bath
December 25th 16:18

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:25.620
<i>She's lived overseas for years and 
doesn't know much about Japan.</i>

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:28.370
<i>His little sister, huh?</i>

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:32.130
<i>I was worried about her, so I wanted her 
somewhere I could keep an eye on her.</i>

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.630
<i>That doesn't mean he had to hide her.</i>

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.710
So this is a bath?

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:01.740
Wait! You haven't done anything 
with your hair, Fierte.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:07.250
I see. Now it won't get wet.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.240
So this is what they call a "bath."

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:16.040
It's wonderful.

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:17.760
Simply wonderful.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.090
<i>I didn't expect her to like it this much.</i>

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.760
<i>Maybe they didn't take 
baths where she was?</i>

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:26.060
<i>She had weird clothes 
on, and she's blonde.</i>

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.680
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Men's Shared Bath

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.480
<i>I guess things really are 
different outside of Japan.</i>

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:32.460
I never thought she'd actually believe that.

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:35.190
I guess Aina's a pretty good girl.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.700
I'm very satisfied.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:43.700
Where'd you get those clothes?

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.260
Aina let me borrow them.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:49.170
She's a very considerate human.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:52.600
I see. I'll have to thank her later.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.040
Fierte, huh?

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:59.880
She's a little weird, but I 
hope I can get along with her.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:00.420
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.380
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms
December 25th 16:37

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.380
The food, the baths...

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:06.070
Human life is rather nice, isn't it?

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:07.390
I'm glad you like it.

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:12.600
<i>She looks just like a normal girl right now.</i>

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:14.770
Fierte?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.150
Something's coming.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:20.030
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Roof
December 25th 16:51

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.570
Those guys again?

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:25.790
Huh?

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:33.580
I see your wounds have healed.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:36.380
Yes. You caught me off guard last night,

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:39.090
but with the resources he's providing me,

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:42.260
I won't lose to a barbaric beast like you.

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.090
That's big talk for an angel.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.070
You're the human

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:52.020
who's been hunting angels 
with a black Z/X, aren't you?

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:55.520
That's right.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:57.770
You've done that to other angels, too?

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:01.780
I'm taking revenge on the angels!

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.530
Now, let's finish our battle.

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:11.210
Don't get in my way this time, kid.

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:12.660
Wait.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:16.290
Do you know what's below us?

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.920
A dorm—

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:19.790
A bath!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:29.800
I will not let you destroy the 
place of rest that I've found!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:33.180
You little...

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:37.190
If you want to fight, let's do it 
somewhere more appropriate.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:40.160
No!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:41.440
What do we do?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:43.320
Follow them, Sieger.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.320
Kobe Skies

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:49.660
Once again, Asuka and Fierte 
encounter Ayase Kamiyugi,

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:50.530
Kobe Skies
December 25th 17:03

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.080
the angel hunter.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:56.290
Asuka senses Fierte's desire 
to fight for her comrades,

00:21:56.790 --> 00:22:00.500
and wonders if there's any 
way to stop this battle.

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:44.010
Next time on <i>Z/X Ignition</i>:

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:55.790
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:46.070
Phase 3.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:52.280
What color is the future 
Azumi Kagamihara will weave?
